                    <msContents>
                        <summary><p>This manuscript consists of six distinct works regarding magical and astrological treatises: "De situatione stellarum in 12 signis", "De 12 signis et eorum occulitis virtutibus", "Picatrix", "De civitatibus et provinciis sub signis" and "De imaginibus septem planetarum". ff. 12r-13v is blank.</p>
                            <note>It was written in Ferrara, Northern Italy.</note>
                        </summary>
                            <textLang mainLang="la" source="IANA">Latin</textLang>
                    </msContents>
